<title>USA: Culbro Corp Q3 operating net rose.</title>
<headline>Culbro Corp Q3 operating net rose.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.67		    $0.56</p>
<p> Oper net		    3,127		    2,489</p>
<p> Revs			 50,831		   43,329</p>
<p> Avg shrs		    4,678		    4,538</p>
<p>			Nine Months</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $1.43		    $1.34</p>
<p> Oper net		    6,660		    5,890</p>
<p> Revs			137,505		  120,846</p>
<p> Avg shrs		    4,656		    4,386</p>
<p>	    (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1996 operating net excludes losses from discontinued operations or 1,311,000, or $0.28/shr, in quarter and $543,000, or $0.12/shr, in nine months, which include loss on sale of DMS Gilbreth of about $1.3 million.</p>
<p>1995 operating net excludes profits from discontinued operations of $556,000, or $0.12/shr, in quarter and $2667,000, or $0.61/shr, in nine months.</p>
<p>1995 nine mth net from continuing operations includes gain of about $2.1 million from an insurance settlement.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
